{"tabData": ["1-50", "51-51"], "bookInfo": {"bookId": "42000018637", "bookName": "Envié a mi amante infiel al infierno", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000018637/42000018637.jpg@w=360&h=640", "viewCount": 810328, "followCount": 20366, "introduction": "En su vida pasada, Luis López lo perdió todo por su obsesión con Valeria Reyes, la hija de la empleada. Gastó su fortuna, abandonó la universidad y la separó de su amor de la vida, hasta acabar en la ruina. Al volver al pasado, se aleja de ella, reúne pruebas contra quienes lo dañaron y los hace pagar. Mientras protege a su familia, entra a la universidad soñada y conoce a Silvia Linares, con quien deja atrás el pasado y empieza de nuevo.", "chapterCount": 51, "labels": ["Rebirth", "Modern"], "tags": ["Rebirth", "Modern"], "typeTwoIds": [304, 309, 326, 303], "typeTwoNames": ["Venganza", "Contraataque", "Viaje en el Tiempo", "Urbano"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 304, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}, {"id": 309, "name": "Contraataque", "replaceName": "contraataque"}, {"id": 326, "name": "Viaje en el Tiempo", "replaceName": "viaje-en-el-tiempo"}, {"id": 303, "name": "Urbano", "replaceName": "urbano"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Venganza", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Envié-a-mi-amante-infiel-al-infierno", "bookNameLower": "envié-a-mi-amante-infiel-al-infierno", "shelfTime": "2026-06-27 12:00:02", "firstShelfTime": "2026-06-27 12:00:02", "performerIdList": []}, "recommends": [{"bookId": "42000033845", "bookName": "Pensaba que era heterosexual hasta que él me besó", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000033845/42000033845.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 439, "introduction": "Med student Miles catches his influencer girlfriend cheating. To get back at her, he stages a “fake affair” — only to accidentally kiss the handsome CEO, Hunter. He swore he didn’t like men… and Miles thought he was straight too. 